  "Minta is named for Araminta “Minty” Ross, the name Harriet Tubman was born with. Tubman said she “never lost a passenger.” We make no comparison to what she and so many others endured. We named Minta to carry a little of her spirit: no family left behind.": "Minta 的名字來自 Araminta “Minty” Ross，這是 Harriet Tubman 出生時的名字。Tubman 曾說，她「從未失去過一位乘客」。我們無意將任何事與她以及許多其他人所承受的苦難相比。我們取名 Minta，是希望傳承她的一點精神：不讓任何一個家庭掉隊。",
